{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CebJQCgcXP7kogTeZMCCa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Task List: transparency in search\n\n**Job:** `pair_transparency-in-search` — branch `feature/pair_transparency-in-search`\n\n**Branch check:** No shell/git tool is available to me in this session, so I could not run `git branch --show-current` to confirm. Per the job instructions the mounted workspace should already be this job's worktree on the correct branch — flagging this as unverified rather than guessing.\n\n## Findings\n\nThe \"expanding overlay search input\" UI pattern (icon button → click → animated-width input with a clear button, `svelte/transition` fade, closes on Escape/click) exists in exactly two places:\n\n1. `src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte` — used by all library headers (`Header.svelte`).\n2. `src/lib/components/contacts/Search.svelte` — used by `ContactHeader.svelte`.\n\nComparing to the reference (`src/lib/components/ui/Notifications.svelte`, which uses `bg-c-neutral/60 backdrop-blur-sm ... dark:bg-s-dark/80` for its frosted-glass look):\n\n- `libraries/shared/Search.svelte` input has `bg-transparent` + `backdrop-blur-xs` — the blur class is present but there's no tinted/semi-opaque background, so it doesn't read as \"frosted glass\" against the list content behind it.\n- `contacts/Search.svelte` input has `bg-c-bg-surface` (fully opaque) and **no** backdrop-blur class at all — this one has lost the effect entirely.\n\nOther \"search\" hits in the repo (`admin/UserList.svelte`, `libraries/shared/LibrarySearchModal.svelte`, `feeds/FeedNavigation.svelte`, etc.) are different UI patterns (inline solid search bars or modal-based search), not the same floating expanding-input component, so they appear out of scope per the brief's wording (\"It seems... search functionality in libraries... same search functionality elsewhere\" — read as: this one specific pattern, reused in contacts).\n\n## Tasks\n\n**TASK-1**\n- Description: Restore a semi-transparent, blurred background to the expanding search input in `libraries/shared/Search.svelte` so it visually matches the frosted-glass treatment used in `UiNotifications`/`Notifications.svelte`.\n- Files: `src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte`\n- Dependencies: none\n- Risk: low — isolated class change on a single input element, no logic touched.\n\n**TASK-2**\n- Description: Add the missing transparency + backdrop-blur treatment to the expanding search input in `contacts/Search.svelte`, matching the same reference style (currently fully opaque with no blur at all).\n- Files: `src/lib/components/contacts/Search.svelte`\n- Dependencies: none (can be done independently of TASK-1, but should end up visually consistent with it)\n- Risk: low — isolated class change, but should be checked in both light and dark theme since current class list has no dark-mode variant at all.\n\n**TASK-3**\n- Description: Manually verify (via a render/screenshot, not implementation) that both search inputs look consistent with each other and with `UiNotifications` across light/dark themes and at both collapsed/expanded states.\n- Files: none (verification only)\n- Dependencies: TASK-1, TASK-2\n- Risk: low — verification step, no code risk, but important since this is a purely visual/CSS bug.\n\n## Explicitly not proposed as tasks (flagging for confirmation, not guessing scope)\n\n- `admin/UserList.svelte` search bar — different, always-visible solid search input in an admin settings panel; not the same overlay pattern and not \"in libraries,\" likely out of scope.\n- `libraries/shared/LibrarySearchModal.svelte` — a full modal search (already routes through `ContentModal`, which has its own modal-blur treatment), not the overlay input pattern referenced in the brief.\n\nIf the intent was actually broader (e.g., also touching the admin search bar or the search modal), the brief should be clarified before work starts — the brief's \"elsewhere\" is ambiguous."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":27849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"784cb417-57a2-40bd-8907-94698a6375a0","uuid":"bf440782-7daf-4e97-9b55-05962c2ca6c5","timestamp":"2026-08-31T18:29:38.369Z","request_id":"req_011CebJQ4FMz62FPHMbgt45F"}
