{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019SXrpUsRhMGcrsUXeLoBeG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brief: transparency in search\n2\t\n3\tstatus: open\n4\ttype: feature\n5\tid: pair\n6\tbranch: feature/pair_transparency-in-search\n7\tdate: 2026-08-31\n8\tauthor: Leander Muskalla\n9\t\n10\t## What\n11\t\n12\tIt seems to me the transparency + blur effect got lost on search functionality in libraries. We might utilize the same search fucntionaliyt elesewhere, so look for that as well.\n13\tIt should utilize transparency and blur. For reference: look at UiNotifications, they render as expected. The search input field should be the same.\n14\t\n15\t## Why\n16\t\n17\t<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n18\t\n19\t## Out of scope\n20\t\n21\t<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n22\t\n23\t## Notes\n24\t\n25\t<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b1fa74e-133f-412a-b1d1-fda7275fc307","uuid":"47482467-a860-4ba0-b821-c4353f4fd19f","timestamp":"2026-08-31T18:31:38.414Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/pair_transparency-in-search/brief.md","content":"# Brief: transparency in search\n\nstatus: open\ntype: feature\nid: pair\nbranch: feature/pair_transparency-in-search\ndate: 2026-08-31\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIt seems to me the transparency + blur effect got lost on search functionality in libraries. We might utilize the same search fucntionaliyt elesewhere, so look for that as well.\nIt should utilize transparency and blur. For reference: look at UiNotifications, they render as expected. The search input field should be the same.\n\n## Why\n\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n\n## Notes\n\n<!-- Anything the analyst or devel